because the Angles and Saxons were the
largest of the migrating peoples. But, if in a
game they aren't the largest of the migrating
peoples, should we rename England and the
Anglo-Saxon culture to be based around the
new relevant cultures (and potentially cause
issues when converting to future games), or
create new cultures/titles to represent the
unified peoples? Or just continue calling it all
England/Anglo-Saxon for simplicity?<y:LabelModel><y:SmartNodeLabelModel distance="4.0"/></y:LabelModel><y:ModelParameter><y:SmartNodeLabelModelParameter labelRatioX="0.0" labelRatioY="0.0" nodeRatioX="0.0" nodeRatioY="0.0" offsetX="0.0" offsetY="0.0" upX="0.0" upY="-1.0"/></y:ModelParameter></y:NodeLabel>
