              <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="12" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" height="209.81640625" horizontalTextPosition="center" iconTextGap="4" modelName="custom" textColor="#000000" verticalTextPosition="bottom" visible="true" width="138.05078125" x="-3.0668227631140326" xml:space="preserve" y="1.1123984865355965">It seems like Swabia was
called both Swabia and
Alemannia, until later
when Swabia stuck, and
