Basque/Aquitanian, despite them being
Celtiberian cultures. This is likely because
they are some of the known tribes that were
conquered by the Vascones (early Basque).

Caristian doesn't seem to actually be used
in game, and their tribe is made Autrigonian.

Vardulian also isn't used in game, and their
tribe is made Vascones, so if at least one of
them is made to map to Basque, it'd likely be
them. But what should be done about
Autrigonian and Caristian?<y:LabelModel><y:SmartNodeLabelModel distance="4.0"/></y:LabelModel><y:ModelParameter><y:SmartNodeLabelModelParameter labelRatioX="0.0" labelRatioY="0.0" nodeRatioX="0.0" nodeRatioY="0.0" offsetX="0.0" offsetY="0.0" upX="0.0" upY="-1.0"/></y:ModelParameter></y:NodeLabel>
